            "value": "ARIA analizează proprietatea ta…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ARIA is your AI property assistant powered by Claude. It has context about your tasks, finances, and documents, so you can ask it anything about your home.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ARIA ist Ihr KI-Immobilienassistent, der von Claude betrieben wird. Er hat Kontext über Ihre Aufgaben, Finanzen und Dokumente, sodass Sie alles über Ihr Zuhause fragen können."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ARIA is your AI property assistant powered by Claude. It has context about your tasks, finances, and documents, so you can ask it anything about your home."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ARIA est votre assistant immobilier IA propulsé par Claude. Il a le contexte de vos tâches, finances et documents, vous pouvez donc lui poser n'importe quelle question sur votre maison."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ARIA is uw AI-woningassistent aangedreven door Claude. Het heeft context over uw taken, financiën en documenten, zodat u het alles over uw huis kunt vragen."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ARIA este asistentul tău AI pentru proprietate, bazat pe Claude. Are context despre sarcinile, finanțele și documentele tale, astfel că îl poți întreba orice despre locuința ta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
