    "Yes — all data is stored in Supabase (PostgreSQL) with automatic daily backups. Your data is safe even if you change devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja — alle Daten werden in Supabase (PostgreSQL) mit automatischen täglichen Backups gespeichert. Ihre Daten sind sicher, auch wenn Sie das Gerät wechseln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes — all data is stored in Supabase (PostgreSQL) with automatic daily backups. Your data is safe even if you change devices."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui — toutes les données sont stockées dans Supabase (PostgreSQL) avec des sauvegardes automatiques quotidiennes. Vos données sont en sécurité même si vous changez d'appareils."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja — alle gegevens worden opgeslagen in Supabase (PostgreSQL) met automatische dagelijkse back-ups. Uw gegevens zijn veilig, zelfs als u van apparaat wisselt."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da — toate datele sunt stocate în Supabase (PostgreSQL) cu copii de rezervă zilnice automate. Datele tale sunt în siguranță chiar dacă schimbi dispozitivele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, mark returned": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja, als zurückgegeben markieren"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes, mark returned"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui, marquer retourné"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja, markeer geretourneerd"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da, marchează ca returnat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes. Go to Settings → Family Members → tap the invite icon. Enter their email — they'll receive a link to join your property.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja. Gehen Sie zu Einstellungen → Familienmitglieder → tippen Sie auf das Einladungssymbol. Geben Sie deren E-Mail ein — sie erhalten einen Link, um Ihrer Immobilie beizutreten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes. Go to Settings → Family Members → tap the invite icon. Enter their email — they'll receive a link to join your property."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui. Allez dans Paramètres → Membres de la famille → appuyez sur l'icône d'invitation. Entrez leur email — ils recevront un lien pour rejoindre votre propriété."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja. Ga naar Instellingen → Gezinsleden → tik op het uitnodigingspictogram. Voer hun e-mail in — ze ontvangen een link om uw woning te koppelen."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da. Accesează Setări → Membrii familiei → apasă iconița de invitație. Introdu e-mailul lor — vor primi un link pentru a se alătura proprietății tale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes. Go to your Profile → Security & Privacy → Export My Data. You'll get a JSON file with all your tasks, finances, documents, and more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja. Gehen Sie zu Ihrem Profil → Sicherheit & Datenschutz → Meine Daten exportieren. Sie erhalten eine JSON-Datei mit allen Aufgaben, Finanzen, Dokumenten und mehr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes. Go to your Profile → Security & Privacy → Export My Data. You'll get a JSON file with all your tasks, finances, documents, and more."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui. Allez dans votre Profil → Sécurité & Confidentialité → Exporter mes données. Vous obtiendrez un fichier JSON avec toutes vos tâches, finances, documents et plus."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ja. Ga naar uw Profiel → Beveiliging & Privacy → Exporteer mijn gegevens. U ontvangt een JSON-bestand met al uw taken, financiën, documenten en meer."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da. Accesează Profilul tău → Securitate & Confidențialitate → Exportă datele mele. Vei primi un fișier JSON cu toate sarcinile, finanțele, documentele și altele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
